<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>What we do for you</h2>
  <p class="lead">Buying, selling or renting, one team handles it from first visit to final paperwork.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><span class="ic">🏠</span><b>Residential properties</b><span>Find your perfect home for a better living.</span></div>
